<main class="pc" data-product-contact="2"><p class="pc-kicker">CRANIO SYSTEMS / Contact</p><h1>Contactez-nous.</h1><p class="pc-lead">Rendez-vous, formation, partenariats et questions générales.</p><section class="pc-section"><div class="pc-contact"><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">CRANIO SYSTEMS</p><h2>ROOT FRONTIER SYSTEMS</h2><a class="pc-link" href="mailto:rootfrontier.office@gmail.com">rootfrontier.office@gmail.com</a><div class="pc-actions"><a class="pc-button" href="../your-cranium/">Personal Navigator</a></div></div><div class="pc-card"><form data-contact-product action="https://formsubmit.co/rootfrontier.office@gmail.com" method="POST"><input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="CRANIO SYSTEMS — website enquiry"><label for="contact-name">Nom</label><input id="contact-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="120" required><label for="contact-email">Votre e-mail</label><input id="contact-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254" required><label for="contact-topic">Sujet</label><select id="contact-topic" name="topic"><option>Rendez-vous</option><option>Formation</option><option>Technologie et partenariats</option><option>Autre demande</option></select><label for="contact-message">Message</label><textarea id="contact-message" name="message" maxlength="3000" required></textarea><p class="pc-note">FormSubmit → rootfrontier.office@gmail.com. Ne transmettez pas de diagnostics, de dossiers médicaux ou d'informations confidentielles.</p><div class="pc-actions"><button type="submit">Envoyer</button></div><p role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><script type="application/json" data-contact-strings>["Envoi…","Le service a accepté la demande. La réponse sera envoyée par e-mail.","Envoi non confirmé. Veuillez nous écrire directement."]</script></form></div></div></section></main>